      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَامَلَهُ مُزَامَنَةً</span></b>  (S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِمَانًا</span> (Lh, TA) [<i>He
bargained,</i> or <i>made an engagement, with him, to
work, for a time</i>], (S, K,) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الزَّمَنُ</span>. (S,) is
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَاهَرَةً</span> [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِهَارًا</span>] (S, K) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّهْرُ</span>. (S.)

